WEBVTT

00:03.167 --> 00:06.167
I'm not... letting anyone kill me.

00:12.927 --> 00:15.317
It really is a desert.

00:31.557 --> 00:33.617
Wh-What the hell is that thing?!

00:41.587 --> 00:42.487
No!

01:02.677 --> 01:04.257
What the hell?

01:04.747 --> 01:07.837
What am I even supposed to do?

01:08.397 --> 01:12.067
Answer me, Subaru Natsuki!

01:16.637 --> 01:18.547
No! No! No!

01:21.567 --> 01:25.277
Someone... Someone help me!

01:51.327 --> 01:53.647
I'm underneath... the desert?

02:05.337 --> 02:06.407
Shit...

02:06.407 --> 02:08.537
Shit, shit, shit!

02:08.537 --> 02:10.377
What the hell?! What the hell?!

02:10.377 --> 02:12.737
What the hell do you want from me?!

03:50.417 --> 03:53.317
That's the third one.

03:57.297 --> 03:58.997
How long has it been?

03:59.447 --> 04:01.747
Three hours? Four hours?

04:14.007 --> 04:14.967
Ow...

04:16.717 --> 04:17.867
Damn it!

04:44.707 --> 04:46.267
Screw you!

04:46.267 --> 04:50.327
Why?! Why do you have to be in my way?!

04:52.777 --> 04:54.317
Wh... What the...

04:54.857 --> 04:58.047
Damn it, stop screwing with me!

05:02.177 --> 05:03.037
Huh?

05:10.967 --> 05:13.767
I did all that running...

05:14.537 --> 05:16.677
and running... and running...

05:21.027 --> 05:22.057
I'm done.

05:23.537 --> 05:25.297
I'll just kill you.

05:35.607 --> 05:38.307
I don't know who you are...

05:39.867 --> 05:41.957
but I'll kill you.

05:41.957 --> 05:45.157
I swear I'm gonna kill you.

05:45.607 --> 05:49.257
Kill you... Kill you... Kill you...

05:49.917 --> 05:51.127
Kill you...

05:51.367 --> 05:52.297
Kill you...

05:52.607 --> 05:53.457
Kill you...

05:53.757 --> 05:54.627
Kill you...

05:54.887 --> 05:55.797
Kill you...

05:56.007 --> 05:56.967
Kill you...

05:57.127 --> 05:58.337
Kill you...

05:58.927 --> 06:01.857
Kill you... Kill you... Kill you...

06:01.857 --> 06:07.517
Kill you, kill you, kill you, kill you,
kill you, kill you, kill you, kill you...

06:38.457 --> 06:42.297
So... it wasn't Shaula, then...

06:45.777 --> 06:48.477
Beatrice and Meili are kids.

06:48.477 --> 06:49.727
They'd be easy.

06:50.197 --> 06:52.937
Emilia didn't seem that wary of me.

06:53.337 --> 06:57.067
In that sense, the most dangerous 
ones are Ram and Echidna.

06:57.527 --> 06:59.217
Julius, too.

06:59.217 --> 07:02.447
It'd be great if he'd
 just die on his own...

07:03.317 --> 07:04.447
Huh?

07:46.487 --> 07:49.737
The only ones I haven't seen 
are Emilia and Beatrice.

07:49.737 --> 07:51.947
One of those two is—

07:56.127 --> 07:57.427
Oh, it's you?

08:10.917 --> 08:12.487
Stop following me!

08:12.487 --> 08:15.267
I don't have time to play with you!

08:15.267 --> 08:19.227
I have to kill everyone who's still alive!

08:21.187 --> 08:25.017
If you're gonna get in my way, then...

08:39.797 --> 08:40.607
Damn it!

08:40.607 --> 08:43.417
Damn it! Damn it, damn it, damn it!

08:43.417 --> 08:46.087
What the hell?! What the hell is this?!

08:46.087 --> 08:48.797
You and all the others...

08:48.797 --> 08:51.057
the dead bodies and
the ones who are alive...

08:51.057 --> 08:52.777
What the hell are you thinking?!

08:52.777 --> 08:54.187
What are you trying to do?!

08:54.607 --> 08:57.437
I don't give a shit about any of you!

08:57.897 --> 09:01.397
You're all just shoving 
your problems onto me!

09:01.397 --> 09:04.147
If you're all so
preoccupied with yourselves,

09:04.147 --> 09:06.167
what about me?!

09:07.167 --> 09:10.527
I'm busy with my own damn problems, too!

09:18.227 --> 09:22.197
Why can't you just... leave me alone?

09:22.747 --> 09:27.177
Just leave me all by myself!

09:36.947 --> 09:38.897
Ow! Are you—

10:05.257 --> 10:06.417
No!

10:06.417 --> 10:08.127
I don't wanna die!

10:10.727 --> 10:12.807
Lizard!

10:35.867 --> 10:37.707
What... the...

10:39.797 --> 10:43.227
Just what the hell are you?

10:45.377 --> 10:48.997
Try to figure it out next time,

10:48.997 --> 10:50.767
hero.

10:57.417 --> 10:58.437
Subaru!

10:59.137 --> 11:01.517
Hey, Subaru! Are you all right?

11:01.927 --> 11:04.317
Emi...lia...

11:04.677 --> 11:06.587
Oh, what a relief!

11:06.587 --> 11:08.827
I was so worried about you!

11:13.297 --> 11:13.987
Subaru?

11:15.627 --> 11:16.737
What is it?

11:19.077 --> 11:21.527
He's still half-asleep, I suppose.

11:21.527 --> 11:25.327
How very easygoing, especially 
after he worried us so much.

11:27.367 --> 11:28.427
You!

11:30.967 --> 11:33.447
I'm not happy with this, I suppose!

11:33.447 --> 11:37.097
Emilia and Betty were
the ones who found him!

11:38.187 --> 11:39.517
Now, don't sulk.

11:39.517 --> 11:43.867
What's wrong with it? Subaru 
and Patrasche are really close.

11:47.047 --> 11:48.147
Hey, Subaru...

11:48.497 --> 11:50.607
Are you sure you're feeling all right?

11:50.607 --> 11:54.447
Yeah, I'm totally fine. No prob.

11:54.447 --> 11:56.617
I guess all the tiredness
finally got to me.

11:56.617 --> 11:59.597
People fall asleep all the time, y'know?

11:59.597 --> 12:00.537
I see...

12:01.007 --> 12:03.327
But when you feel tired, tell us.

12:03.667 --> 12:05.637
You mustn't push yourself too hard.

12:09.497 --> 12:11.587
<i>It's gonna make things risky,</i>

12:11.587 --> 12:15.047
<i>but I won't tell them about 
my memory loss this time.</i>

12:15.527 --> 12:20.207
<i>I want to find out if it's connected 
to the reason I keep getting killed.</i>

12:20.207 --> 12:25.797
<i>Frankly, I could see killing someone over 
something you don't want them to remember,</i>

12:25.797 --> 12:29.897
<i>but it's hard to imagine killing 
someone because they forgot something.</i>

12:32.587 --> 12:33.697
Subaru.

12:34.207 --> 12:36.907
You've got that wrinkle 
on your forehead again.

12:38.527 --> 12:42.517
What did I do for her to get 
that close with me, anyway?

12:44.867 --> 12:49.087
<i>I didn't find their bodies, but...</i>

12:49.087 --> 12:52.457
Try to figure it out next time,

12:52.777 --> 12:54.377
hero.

12:55.007 --> 12:57.877
<i>That voice didn't belong
to either of them.</i>

12:57.877 --> 13:00.877
<i>In fact, no one in this group sounds like—</i>

12:59.927 --> 13:00.877
Barusu.

13:03.287 --> 13:06.327
Stop spacing out and help me fetch water.

13:06.327 --> 13:08.347
Oops, sorry.

13:08.347 --> 13:10.187
I hear you were sleeping in the archive.

13:10.797 --> 13:13.427
You shouldn't try anything stupid.

13:13.427 --> 13:15.277
You'll only trouble those around you.

13:15.637 --> 13:18.017
Yeah, I know I shouldn't have done it.

13:18.017 --> 13:20.637
Sorry for making you worry, too.

13:20.637 --> 13:23.027
Worry about you? Why would I?

13:23.027 --> 13:24.867
For my safety, I guess?

13:25.527 --> 13:27.787
Good morning, Master!

13:27.787 --> 13:30.477
Did you sleep well last night?

13:32.627 --> 13:35.417
I slept great, thanks for asking!

13:35.417 --> 13:37.507
I had a dream about the past, actually!

13:37.507 --> 13:41.637
It was you and me, and my mom, and...

13:41.637 --> 13:45.237
Okay, okay, I get it. You 
can tell me about it later.

13:45.237 --> 13:49.407
Anyway, did you notice anything about 
me when you saw me this morning?

13:49.407 --> 13:51.487
This morning?

13:51.487 --> 13:53.787
You looked as sexy as ever!

13:53.787 --> 13:55.897
I've been waiting 400 
years for you to propose!

13:55.897 --> 13:58.367
You've got some real patience.

13:58.367 --> 14:00.647
Well, if you didn't notice 
anything, it's all good.

14:00.647 --> 14:01.807
Really?

14:14.797 --> 14:17.187
Shaula, I have a favor to ask.

14:17.187 --> 14:19.257
Huh? What is it?

14:20.787 --> 14:21.717
Julius.

14:23.427 --> 14:25.927
I want to talk about what 
happened last night.

14:26.487 --> 14:28.357
Just the two of us, you know?

14:31.797 --> 14:34.397
About... last night?

14:34.967 --> 14:38.017
I thought that conversation was over.

14:38.017 --> 14:39.697
Do you disagree?

14:39.697 --> 14:41.357
Yeah, I sure do.

14:41.357 --> 14:44.867
I wasn't satisfied with 
that in the slightest.

14:48.247 --> 14:50.787
Satisfied, eh?

14:50.787 --> 14:53.037
I see. That's very like you.

14:53.857 --> 14:56.887
But do you not feel that's 
a bit too selfish of you?

14:56.887 --> 15:00.067
You don't look satisfied 
with how it ended, either.

15:00.067 --> 15:03.387
We're both holding on to 
something that pisses us off,

15:03.387 --> 15:05.657
and you expect me to just live with it?

15:05.657 --> 15:07.317
Like hell I can.

15:07.317 --> 15:10.807
Well, then, what other choice do we have?

15:11.447 --> 15:14.477
My feelings are exactly 
as I told you last night.

15:14.477 --> 15:17.197
I have nothing further to say.

15:17.767 --> 15:21.547
Because I knew nothing at all of the 
secret between you and Lady Anastasia—

15:21.547 --> 15:23.907
that is, you and Echidna.

15:24.527 --> 15:27.487
The secret... between me and Echidna?

15:27.487 --> 15:30.547
I understand that you meant no harm.

15:31.227 --> 15:34.867
And I spoke with Echidna, 
though not nearly enough.

15:34.867 --> 15:36.647
She can be trusted.

15:37.127 --> 15:40.527
Rather, there is no other 
option but to trust her.

15:41.207 --> 15:43.637
If I hope to save Lady Anastasia,

15:43.637 --> 15:46.347
then I have to bet on the possibility.

15:48.647 --> 15:50.327
Even if we get her back

15:50.987 --> 15:54.147
and she doesn't remember who I am...

15:54.957 --> 15:56.867
What... do you mean?

15:58.037 --> 15:59.037
Honestly...

15:59.927 --> 16:03.347
Please don't make me feel any 
more pathetic in your presence.

16:07.837 --> 16:11.787
When you mentioned what happened 
last night, it frightened me a bit.

16:12.327 --> 16:15.807
I didn't know what I would 
do if you apologized to me.

16:16.257 --> 16:19.757
If I... apologized?

16:20.077 --> 16:24.267
If you had, how would I have responded?

16:25.037 --> 16:28.137
There's no way to know now, however.

16:43.567 --> 16:46.737
Master, you sure you want 
to leave things like that?

16:47.057 --> 16:48.427
Yeah.

16:48.427 --> 16:52.247
Seems like Julius had nothing to do 
with what happened in the archive.

16:52.247 --> 16:56.267
Except now he's even more suspicious 
of who I was yesterday.

16:56.267 --> 16:58.127
I don't really get it,

16:58.127 --> 17:00.747
but was I useful to you?

17:01.087 --> 17:02.757
Yeah. You totally were.

17:03.237 --> 17:08.007
I was able to confront Julius without 
fear because you were there.

17:09.817 --> 17:11.877
Glad to hear it!

17:11.877 --> 17:14.767
Well, then, Master, Master...

17:14.767 --> 17:18.517
I want a big hug as a reward!

17:18.517 --> 17:19.387
Not doing that.

17:19.387 --> 17:21.377
What?! That's so mean!

17:21.377 --> 17:24.167
You said you'd give me any reward I wanted

17:24.167 --> 17:26.877
as long as it wasn't way out of bounds!

17:26.877 --> 17:29.847
And that goes beyond the 
boundaries of my innocence.

17:31.367 --> 17:38.367
So just what were you doing to be 
targeted and by whom, Subaru Natsuki?

17:39.107 --> 17:41.477
I'm stuck at an impasse.

17:41.477 --> 17:43.717
I'm starting to think
I should ask Patrasche.

17:43.717 --> 17:46.087
What? The land dragon?

17:46.087 --> 17:48.537
I don't like her. She keeps glaring at me.

17:48.537 --> 17:51.917
Hey! I won't let you badmouth Patrasche!

17:51.917 --> 17:54.957
Even if badmouthing anyone was acceptable,

17:54.957 --> 17:57.557
Patrasche is the only one 
I won't let you badmouth!

17:57.557 --> 18:01.357
Master, just how much has that 
land dragon emasculated you?

18:01.357 --> 18:05.427
So on that note, you and I are done here.

18:05.427 --> 18:06.567
See ya.

18:06.567 --> 18:10.397
What?! You just turned a 
blind eye to my reward!

18:10.397 --> 18:12.697
But I will not lose heart!

18:12.697 --> 18:17.547
To be a woman who's convenient 
to you is my reason for living!

18:19.457 --> 18:24.297
What about Subaru Natsuki 
makes him worth all that?

18:25.587 --> 18:26.757
Master?

18:26.757 --> 18:28.217
Oh, damn it!

18:34.137 --> 18:38.567
You don't have to think about 
being convenient to me.

18:38.567 --> 18:40.117
I'm sorry.

18:42.277 --> 18:43.707
Master...

18:47.537 --> 18:51.477
Having you there with me 
was a big help. That's all.

18:52.867 --> 18:54.107
Master...

18:55.787 --> 18:56.777
At long last...

18:57.577 --> 19:01.247
you're ready to love me?!

19:02.147 --> 19:03.777
My boundaries!

19:16.557 --> 19:19.307
If the way they all acted was phony,

19:19.307 --> 19:22.217
I don't know what I'm supposed to believe.

19:25.687 --> 19:29.357
I guess Patrasche really is 
the only one I can trust.

19:30.587 --> 19:34.917
Maybe I'd be happier living in a 
paradise for just me and her—

19:34.917 --> 19:36.987
Uh-oh. I heard that.

19:36.987 --> 19:37.577
Wha?!

19:39.787 --> 19:43.927
So you want to run somewhere 
far away with Patrasche?

19:43.927 --> 19:47.777
Beatrice and Big Sister would 
cry if they heard that.

19:47.777 --> 19:50.007
It was just a bad joke.

19:50.007 --> 19:52.357
Forget about it. In every sense.

19:52.357 --> 19:54.167
Yeah, sure.

19:54.167 --> 19:58.767
But even if that's how you really 
feel, I won't laugh at you.

19:59.167 --> 20:03.517
I've lived with mabeasts 
all my life, remember?

20:03.517 --> 20:05.107
Mabeasts...

20:05.847 --> 20:08.277
So it's kinda like you
were raised by wolves?

20:09.657 --> 20:12.237
You said that yesterday, too.

20:12.237 --> 20:14.807
My mom was incredibly strict.

20:14.807 --> 20:19.007
And Elsa, the one I was around 
all the time, was really lax,

20:19.007 --> 20:21.967
so there was a lot I had to take care of.

20:21.967 --> 20:25.507
Okay, wait, wait! You keep putting 
more and more holes in my brain!

20:25.507 --> 20:27.247
Look, I'm busy right now.

20:27.247 --> 20:28.997
Go play with Shaula or something.

20:28.997 --> 20:31.037
The half-naked lady?

20:31.037 --> 20:32.697
I'm fine with that,

20:32.697 --> 20:35.217
but you're the one I have 
business with right now.

20:35.757 --> 20:37.047
Me?

20:46.007 --> 20:48.357
What you said yesterday...

20:48.357 --> 20:51.567
How seriously should I take that?

20:56.267 --> 20:57.207
Ow...

21:01.197 --> 21:02.977
What is this?

21:12.857 --> 21:14.167
You're kidding me...

21:15.127 --> 21:17.037
No way! No way! No way!

21:17.037 --> 21:17.837
No way!

21:18.167 --> 21:19.267
Meili!

21:19.267 --> 21:21.057
Hey! Meili!

21:22.887 --> 21:24.387
Meili! Meili!

21:24.387 --> 21:25.647
Damn it!

21:29.237 --> 21:30.767
Damn it! Damn it!

21:36.307 --> 21:37.287
I...

21:41.187 --> 21:42.427
killed her?

21:44.217 --> 21:47.037
But why... would I...

22:02.557 --> 22:06.177
<b>Subaru Natsuki Was Here</b>

22:07.057 --> 22:09.937
<b>Empty Shell</b>
